  "limitations": [
    "The two new paths preserve the domain grant and verified receipt models. A true service still needs authoritative first enrollment and authorization of naturally recreated sidecars.",
    "WAL mode, upstream FILESTAT and a single trusted owner were exercised. The default macOS VFS, Apple security scopes, volumes and multi-connection app performance were not measured.",
    "The compatible branch moves one map scan to the read path. The 6.11+ capability was measured on Linux 7.2, and ENOTTY fallback was simulated.",
    "A matching held attachment does not prevent someone changing a pathname after the check. An authenticated connection may not pass certificates across calls."
  ],
